{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.12", "unit_index": 0, "unit_sha256": "a91021c87f05859d7ba0680d4e4a5ca251edf98ae5e5acd8cb182a80d2937cd6", "source_sha256": "16d741dc688a90c5297f428e217a938851774dac9cdd579bdde3d7edfa4f6605", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/rewrite-11-glyph-labels.svg": "a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a"}, "understanding": "左圖白格筆畫構成0、右圖構成1，像素1只代表白格，字串0/1才是整張圖的答案標籤。", "materials_and_labels": "本人真看640與360圖，兩個5×3格、黑白定義及答案配對都清楚。", "expected_change": "若把左圖的標籤也寫1，這是改訓練答案，不是把白像素改黑；兩種數字角色不同。", "confusion_and_quote": "無必要疑點；『希望讀字結果是字串 `\"0\"`、`\"1\"`。』定義了答案層級。", "missing_visuals": "所需字形材料已看，無缺。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [{"figure": "course/figures/rewrite-11-glyph-labels.svg", "source_sha256": "a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a", "details": "本人真看640與360", "observation": "白格像素1和整圖答案字串1分開標示，左右字形0/1與5行3欄可辨。", "status": "verified", "receipt": {"path": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/artifacts/p7_reader_e/36c0a917aaf14efe8f0487c4f93efb0c-11.12-0-a74a4460e256.json", "sha256": "ad0db73b62bb0e5c0a32f6463dbe5ef8a2e8fdeb979720048beb3e4a9595fd89"}, "artifacts": [{"path": "outputs/phase7-render/a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a/640.png", "sha256": "7ff751990303de2fdb90ba3c7c90e34fe67036e3114a3e1cb9b75cb75c14f35a", "width": 640}, {"path": "outputs/phase7-render/a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a/360.png", "sha256": "58769eb589c677d5a564d6e138e26d7a46545e0608c7261c575db08d4b6a9cd2", "width": 360}]}], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 1, "recorded_at": "2026-10-07T00:04:55.951510+00:00", "previous_sha256": "2b889efa752e956f80b47d992dc8a24077bcad8e12974e2723767cec6776d703"}
{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.12", "unit_index": 1, "unit_sha256": "c4f420c7a42f921288dca1dfb13f49c0103f28983cbe64d4f3519903847218e5", "source_sha256": "16d741dc688a90c5297f428e217a938851774dac9cdd579bdde3d7edfa4f6605", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/rewrite-11-glyph-labels.svg": "a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a"}, "understanding": "字典key是字串答案，rows各3位0/1組成5行float張量；glyphs.items()迴圈同時取標籤和筆畫資料。預測shape(5,3)，0圖中3行中間0。", "materials_and_labels": "完整兩個字形和轉tensor程式具體可逐格對圖；尚未讀CPU輸出，不當成實測。", "expected_change": "將第一行111改101，改一個筆畫像素，標籤0仍不會自動變，程式只是配對資料。", "confusion_and_quote": "此處無必要疑點；`for label, rows in glyphs.items():`的key/value用法可從已讀本身推理解，此context不回填原1.2/1.4。", "missing_visuals": "已看字形與程式一致，無缺。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 2, "recorded_at": "2026-10-07T00:05:03.916154+00:00", "previous_sha256": "5d201cfb3f9e75008f7043c71dccd58eb9b9bea9114431a1d70540460122fb50"}
{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.12", "unit_index": 2, "unit_sha256": "6a0de48d2810fec462293db80debf0cec59dbbf310e1fb4ed5842d6841fc4e2b", "source_sha256": "16d741dc688a90c5297f428e217a938851774dac9cdd579bdde3d7edfa4f6605", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/rewrite-11-glyph-labels.svg": "a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a"}, "understanding": "OCR=Optical Character Recognition光學字元辨識。分類挑類別，生成需完整字串，00多字仍錯。此code只建立資料，梯度不能查錯畫。熟悉類別新原圖須每類多原圖、同源變體整組切；原0–99实验字元皆已见，测新组合2/30，不能算新字体/字元泛化。", "materials_and_labels": "名稱、張量5×3、字元/字串/來源家族各層都就地寫明，先前真看字形可支持010→110的筆畫差。", "expected_change": "只把1首行010改110且未改字元，標籤仍1；若模型多吐一字，完整字串判準仍錯。", "confusion_and_quote": "無必要疑點；『這段只建立資料，沒有更新辨識器。』使本例角色明確。2/30為原文報告，未本人重跑該實驗。", "missing_visuals": "必要字形已實看；無新增必要圖。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [{"at": "section_end", "scope": "11.12像素與標籤及OCR", "subject": "OCR及資料切分", "questions": [{"number": 1, "answer": "從圖讀出字元的光學字元辨識，英文Optical Character Recognition。", "claims": [{"status": "explicit", "quote": "從圖片讀出字元稱**光學字元辨識**（Optical Character Recognition，OCR）。", "claim": "OCR中英文名稱現在明示。"}]}, {"number": 2, "answer": "讓像素對應正確文字，可選分類或生成完整串，像素1不是答案1。", "claims": [{"status": "explicit", "quote": "可以用分類頭選 0 或 1，也可以讓文字核心逐步生成答案。", "claim": "可分類或逐步生成。"}]}, {"number": 3, "answer": "先核對字形與答案，建立tensor，再訓練辨識器；同源變體一起切分；目前只有資料建立。", "claims": [{"status": "explicit", "quote": "這段只建立資料，沒有更新辨識器。", "claim": "此段是資料建立，不是訓練結果。"}, {"status": "explicit", "quote": "再把同一原圖及其變體當一個來源家族，整組放在訓練側或留出側。", "claim": "來源家族須整組切。"}]}, {"number": 4, "answer": "字元已見的新字串仍只2/30，不能推出新字體或新字元成功；本次沒有重跑數字。", "claims": [{"status": "explicit", "quote": "最後新字串完整讀對只有 2/30", "claim": "新字串只有2/30。"}, {"status": "explicit", "quote": "這個實驗沒有測新字元類別、另一套字體或手寫。", "claim": "未測新類別或字體。"}]}]}], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 3, "recorded_at": "2026-10-07T00:05:27.325711+00:00", "previous_sha256": "c77ea89afcf8df6b8ebeb79dd8632dc7ea3538c8f0de862b10754df6c95b4587"}
{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.12", "unit_index": 3, "unit_sha256": "9c25cf5d282aad68e3ed0515705cda4006eddb7c94b358c34d23c8b2136e3798", "source_sha256": "16d741dc688a90c5297f428e217a938851774dac9cdd579bdde3d7edfa4f6605", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/rewrite-11-glyph-labels.svg": "a74a4460e2569c88fc0bc02a8ff91fa47de3bc751a67d301627ef2a96c24413a"}, "understanding": "末段是已有限OCR實驗歷史查證入口，不把入口本身當成我重跑或已讀結果檔；回顧10.1/10.5我原warmup確曾讀。", "materials_and_labels": "必要字形已真看；本段無新材料，沒有打開作者實報。", "expected_change": "即使原實報另有完整更新設定，名稱解釋及來源家族限制仍應以本節當下原句理解。", "confusion_and_quote": "無必要卡點；『這是上述有限任務的歷史紀錄。』明示材料角色。", "missing_visuals": "整頁11.12字形位置稍後本人DOM看，當前無缺。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [{"at": "section_end", "scope": "11.12", "subject": "像素標籤與OCR", "questions": [{"number": 1, "answer": "OCR光學字元辨識，Optical Character Recognition，像素值與答案標籤分開。", "claims": [{"claim": "OCR名稱已在本人這次前段讀到。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-02/traces/reader/e/36c0a917aaf14efe8f0487c4f93efb0c.jsonl", "event_index": 3, "quote": "從圖片讀出字元稱**光學字元辨識**（Optical Character Recognition，OCR）。"}]}, {"number": 2, "answer": "配好可见字形與正確文字，為分類或完整字串生成建立資料。", "claims": [{"claim": "資料需人工核對。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-02/traces/reader/e/36c0a917aaf14efe8f0487c4f93efb0c.jsonl", "event_index": 3, "quote": "字形與標籤要人工核對，梯度不會發現畫圖器把 1 畫成 0。"}]}, {"number": 3, "answer": "讀像素→配答案→同源家族整組切→日後訓練/判準；本例尚無更新辨識器。", "claims": [{"claim": "此code不訓練模型。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-02/traces/reader/e/36c0a917aaf14efe8f0487c4f93efb0c.jsonl", "event_index": 3, "quote": "這段只建立資料，沒有更新辨識器。"}]}, {"number": 4, "answer": "2/30為有限歷史報告、非本次測量，未測新字體新字元。", "claims": [{"claim": "歷史紀錄入口不能當作本人實測。", "status": "explicit", "quote": "這是上述有限任務的歷史紀錄。"}, {"claim": "範圍仍有限。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-02/traces/reader/e/36c0a917aaf14efe8f0487c4f93efb0c.jsonl", "event_index": 3, "quote": "這個實驗沒有測新字元類別、另一套字體或手寫。"}]}]}], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 4, "recorded_at": "2026-10-07T00:05:41.064593+00:00", "previous_sha256": "34d4051d4939f6ee91dbb6af0ede4f7c6072b16b97db480bf8df20dfd1535f42"}
